# Everything under output/ is generated and none of it is source:
#   catalog/ embeddings/ features/ models/ run_manifest.json  <- smartamr reproduce
#   figures/                                                  <- smartamr figures
#   DEMO_DATA.md                                              <- smartamr demo
# The figures are deliberately not committed: they would go stale against the
# metrics in output/models/metrics.json the moment the models are retrained,
# and no document references them by path.
output/

